OL,3,AMan admits murder of woman missing for
OL,4,A28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FDunkley's barrister Balbir Singh told
OL,7,FJudge Michael Chambers KC that
OL,8,FLashley's body had never been found,
OL,9,Fand had decomposed after initially
OL,10,Fbeing put in the cellar.
